<!DOCTYPE html>
<html><head><meta charset="utf-8" /><title>{{subject}}</title></head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f1f5f9;font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
<table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%" style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:32px 0;">
  <tr><td align="center">
    <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="600" style="background:#ffffff;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.08);">
      <tr><td>{{>header}}</td></tr>
      <tr><td style="padding:32px;color:#1f2937;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;">
        <p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Hi {{firstName}},</p>
        <p style="margin:0 0 16px;">This is {{agentName}} with <strong>{{brand.name}}</strong>. I wanted to reach out directly so you have a clear point of contact going forward.</p>
        <p style="margin:0 0 16px;">If any questions come up before our next step, just reply to this email or give me a call at <a href="tel:{{agentPhone}}" style="color:{{brand.accentColor}};text-decoration:none;">{{agentPhone}}</a> — happy to walk through whatever you need.</p>
        <p style="margin:0 0 0;">Talk soon,</p>
        {{>signature}}
      </td></tr>
      <tr><td>{{>footer}}</td></tr>
    </table>
  </td></tr>
</table>
</body></html>
